('jack-smith-vol1', 'APPENDIX: KEY FILINGS IN SIGNIFICANT LITIGATION DISTRICT COURT CRIMINAL LITIGATION', 'presidential-immunity-12-22-2023', '142', '(Presidential Immunity)8 Compare SCO-02244118 at 11, 19 (Remarks by Mr. Trump at Save America Rally Ol/06/202 I) (Mr. Trump asserting on January 6 that there were 205,000 more votes than voters in Pennsylvania) with SCO-00709557 at 156 (SJC Tr.) (stating that Mr. Trump was told on January 3 that the allegation that there were more votes than voters in Pennsylvania was untrue); see also SCO-04976459 at 02:06:23-02:07:00 (Video of Arizona State Hearing 11/30/2020) (Co-Conspirator I stating that there could have been "five million illegal aliens in Arizona," and "a few hundred thousand" of those who fraudulently voted, even though the state had a total population of approximately 7.4 million). The Future of the Independent Counsel Act: Hearings before the S. Comm. on Governmental Affairs,Show full note 12/22/2023 Court Order (Petition for a Writ of Certiorari Before Judgment)'),
('jack-smith-vol1', 'APPENDIX: KEY FILINGS IN SIGNIFICANT LITIGATION DISTRICT COURT CRIMINAL LITIGATION', 'trump-v-united-states-no', '142', 'Trump v. United States, No. 23-939 (U.S.) Doc. No. Date Document Descri12tion'),
