('challenger-accident', '4.2 REVISIONS & SUBMITTALS', 'appropriate-conrments-shall-be-included', '353', 'Appropriate conrments shall be included t o insure t h a t t h i s area i s correct an''d complete. Rockwell will conduct FMEA''S f o r a l l interfaces between CFE and GFE. The Rockwell FMEA will consider a l l f a i l u r e modes consistent''with t h i s desk instruction. The analysis is t o consider a s a "RUSE" any f a i l u r e mode identified by the GFE FMEA which could produce a failure i n the CFE interface. Where GFE failures are identified a s a ''CAUSE''. the appropriate GFE FUEA and document number shall be identified a s a part of the "CAUSE" section. In addition, those vehicle failures which could cause M U failure modes will be identified t o NASA In the corrments t o t h e GFE FMEA. Uhere structural failures a r e identified, appropriate hazards analyses shall be 1ncl uded 1n avai 1abl e.'),
