('litvinenko-inquiry', 'Appendix 6: Abbreviations', 'h-closed-hearings-are-hearings', '297', 'h. "Closed hearings" are hearings of the Inquiry to which paragraphs 9 to 14 below apply. This Restriction Notice is to be read as imposing no restriction on the disclosure of any document or information:'),
