('uk-leveson-inquiry', 'PART I CHAPTER', 'appendix-6-bibliography-o-malley', '1987', 'Appendix 6 | Bibliography O''Malley, T, & Soley, C, Regulating the Press, (London, Pluto Press, 2000) Page, B, The Murdoch Archipelago, (London, Simon & Schuster, 2003) Powell, J, The New Machiavelli: How to Wield Power in the Modern World, (London, Vintage 2011) Price, L, Where Power Lies: Prime Ministers v The Media, (London, Simon & Schuster, 2010) Rawnsley, A, The End of the Party, (London, Penguin, 2010) Robertson, G, People Against the Press: An Inquiry into the Press Council, (London, Quartet, 1983) Shannon, R, A Press Free and Responsible: Self Regulation and the Press Complaints Commission, 1991-2001, (London, John Brown, 2001) Shawcross, W, Rupert Murdoch, (Chalto & Windus, London, 1992) Snoddy, R, The Good, the Bad, and the Unacceptable: The Hard News about the British Press, (London: Faber and Faber, 1992) Watson, T, & Hickman, A, Dial M for Murdoch, (London, Allen Lane, 2012) Wolff, M, The Man Who Owns the News, (London, The Bodley House, 2008) Wyatt, W, The Journals of Woodrow Wyatt, Volume One, (London, MacMillan, 1998) Wyatt, W, The Journals of Woodrow Wyatt, Volume Two, (London, MacMillan, 1999) Wyatt, W, The Journals of Woodrow Wyatt, Volume Three, (London, MacMillan, 2000)'),
