('columbia-accident', '3.8 IMPACT ANALYSIS AND TESTING', 'ctf-followed-seven-eleven-digits-3', '83', 'CTF followed by seven to eleven digits, such as CAB001-0010, refer to a document in the Columbia Accident Investigation Board database maintained by the Department of Justice and archived at the National Archives.'),
