('columbia-accident', 'EARMARKS', '44-8-circumstances-dictate-these', '104', '+44.8 circumstances dictate. These changes must be approved by NASAʼs appropriation subcommittees before they can be put into effect. **This reduction primarily reflects the congressional cancellation of the Advanced Solid Rocket Motor Program'),
