('us-deepwater-horizon', 'INDEX', 'tabler-vincent-taffaro-craig-tana', '379', 'Tabler, Vincent, Taffaro, Craig, Tana Oil and Gas Corporation, Taylor, Sharon,142 Testimony of Daun Winslow, August 23, 2010, 454. Transocean asserts that its personnel, including the driller and toolpusher, were not "in any way responsible for interpreting the negative pressure test or making the decision that the well was secure and work could properly pro- ceed." Rachel Clingman, letter to Commission staff, November 16, 2010, 1. As the Commission''s staff made clear at the November 8, 2010 hearing, the Commission is not tasked with deciding legal responsibility. Based on available evidence, however, Revette and Anderson agreed the negative-pressure test was a success and did not stop the job before moving on to the remaining temporary abandonment procedures. Testimony of Lee Lambert, 291; Internal BP documents (BP-HZN-CEC 20347, 20178). Rees, Hostages of Each Other: The Transformation of Nuclear Safety Since Three Mile Island, 104.Show full note Technip, temporary abandonment procedures, 4n, 77, 103; at Macondo well, 4, 6, 103–6, 109, 119–20, 123, 126–27 Tenneco, Texaco, 21, 27, Texas: effects of Macondo oil spill on, 177; oil and gas industry in, 2, 21–53, 58, 217–20, Texas City refinery (BP), 2, 218–22 Thierens, Harry, 3-D seismic imaging, for offshore drilling, 27, 33, 37–38, 42–45 Three Mile Island meltdown (1979), 229, 235, 239, 240n Thunder Horse site, 23, 46-47, Tiber site, Tillerson, Rex, 232, Tolstoy, Maya, 167n Tooms, Paul, 150, top kill, 148–50, 158–59, 161–62, Total (oil company), 43, 44, tourism, effects of Macondo oil spill on, 155, 185–86, 188–91, Trahan, Buddy, 5, 7, 11, 13,17 "Brazil Pins Hopes on Massive, untapped Oil Fields," NPR, December 1, 2009, http://www.npr.org/templates/story/ story.php?storyId=120966523. On Project Mohole and JOIDES, see David K. van Keuren, "Breaking New Ground: The Origins of Scientific Ocean Drilling," in The Machine in Neptune''s Garden: 