('us-v-philip-morris', 'Relationship Between the Tobacco Institute and TIRC/CTR', 'blatnik-committee-which-had-addressed', '104', 'Blatnik Committee which had addressed the disclosure of tar and nicotine yields in advertising, that the tobacco industry needed to have one spokesman, rather than someone from each tobacco company, represent it at various times and places. CTRMIN-SAB000001-1061 at 0114 (JD 090960); 681879254-9715 at 9391 (US 21020); see also Chilcote PD, Minnesota v. Philip Morris, 9/18/97, 27:5-28:6, 30:16-20.'),
