('us-v-philip-morris', 'CTR Special Projects', 'sheffield-joseph-greer-vice-president', '152', 'Sheffield, to Joseph Greer, Vice President and General Counsel for Liggett, enclosed his notes from a September 10, 1981 meeting of the Committee of Counsel. Decker''s notes described a discussion between Arthur Stevens, General Counsel for Lorillard, and Edwin Jacob, CTR attorney with Jacob,'),
