('us-v-philip-morris', 'Lawyers'' Special Accounts', 'william-w-shinn-ed-jacob', '171', 'William W. Shinn, Ed Jacob, and Janet C. Brown acknowledged exactly why Special Account No. 4 was used to fund scientists. Stevens stated:'),
