('us-v-philip-morris', 'Developments Between 1953 and a. Between 1953 and 1964, the Evidence Demonstrating that', 'womble-rodgman-also-served-fact', '286', 'Womble, Rodgman also served as a fact witness for RJR in its defense of various smoking and health cases. Id. at 12:10-16, 27:1-32:8, 33:2-25, 37:1-41:12, 42:14-43:11. Dr. Rodgman''s recantation of the extensive analysis and findings of his research of the late 1950s and 1960s is patently not credible.'),
