('us-v-philip-morris', 'Defendants Were Well Aware that Smoking and Nicotine Are Addictive', 'statement-reveals-both-rjr-s', '411', 'This statement reveals both RJR''s continuing view of smokers as "nicotine seekers" who alter their smoking method to obtain the necessary "dosage" of nicotine, as well as its comprehensive understanding of the compensation phenomenon. 501524500-4514 at 4506 (US 85272).'),
