('us-v-philip-morris', 'Defendants Were Well Aware that Smoking and Nicotine Are Addictive', 'batco-scientists-composed-crellin-ferris', '442', 'BATCo scientists (composed of Crellin, Ferris, Greig, and Milner) forecast what the industry would have to cope with in the near future. The scientists stated that:'),
