25-8039 at 8027 (US 20179); Whidby WD, 21:19-28:9; Whidby TT, 2/22/05, 13989:19- 13991:6; see also 1003293476-3493 at 3484 (US 85073) ("The cassette tape impulses an electronic smoking machine which duplicates exactly the smoking behavior of a given individual with a given cigarette. Delivery of tar, nicotine, and other smoke components can then be determined at the same conditions.").'),
