('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite Their Internal Knowledge, Defendants Publicly Denied that', 'institute-acknowledging-ftc-tar-nicotine', '905', 'Institute acknowledging that FTC tar and nicotine ratings "may be misleading to consumers" and bear no relation to actual consumer intake. Compare 682637627-7629 at 7629 (US 22946) with'),
