('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite Their Internal Knowledge, Defendants'' Marketing and Public', 'not-until-mid-1990s-percentage-sales', '912', 'It was not until the mid-1990s that the percentage of sales made by low tar brands finally equaled the amount that Defendants were spending to promote them, which was about 70% of the industry total. HHS1311770-1805 at 1799 (US 76080); Dolan WD, 125:6-126:7.'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite Their Internal Knowledge, Defendants'' Marketing and Public', 'no-bates-jd-045158-master-settlement', '914', '(no bates) (JD-045158) (Master Settlement Agreement, § III(r)).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite Their Internal Knowledge, Defendants'' Marketing and Public', 'light-ultra-light-t-manufacturers', '915', '"light" and "ultra light," "[t]he manufacturers believe smokers understand that these descriptors are terms of comparison rather than signifiers of absolute value." Joint Comments at 94.'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite Their Internal Knowledge, Defendants'' Marketing and Public', 'defendants-philip-morris-rjr-b', '915', 'Defendants Philip Morris, RJR, B&W, and Lorillard jointly stated in their joint comments to the'),
