('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite Their Internal Knowledge, Defendants'' Marketing and Public', 'defendants-joint-comments-further-stated', '915', 'Defendants'' joint comments further stated: "The manufacturers are not aware of evidence that consumers use descriptors in lieu of the FTC numbers as their primary source of information about the ''tar'' and nicotine yields of different brand styles." Joint Comments at 95.'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite Their Internal Knowledge, Defendants'' Marketing and Public', 'defendants-philip-morris-rjr-b-2', '916', 'Defendants Philip Morris, RJR, B&W, and Lorillard jointly stated:'),
