('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite Their Internal Knowledge, Defendants'' Marketing and Public', '2024921314-1612-1333-1348-1352-1353-us', '938', '2024921314-1612 at 1333, 1348, 1352-1353 (US 20403).'),
