('us-v-philip-morris', 'The Defendants Need Youth as Replacement Smokers', 'report-noting-considerable-evidence-demonstrates', '1005', 'Report noting that "considerable evidence" demonstrates that "advertising and promotion recruit new smokers"). As United States marketing expert Dr. Robert Dolan explained:'),
