('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite the Overwhelming Evidence to the Contrary, Defendants'' Public', 'us-25034', '1209', '(US 25034).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite the Overwhelming Evidence to the Contrary, Defendants'' Public', 'describing-its-marketing-practices-philip', '1209', 'In describing its "marketing practices," Philip Morris states, "Philip Morris USA does not direct its advertising to underage smokers or to non-smokers." With regard to its obligations under the MSA,'),
