('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite the Overwhelming Evidence to the Contrary, Defendants'' Public', 'adults-defined-18-years-age', '1209', '''Adults'' (defined as 18 years of age and older), PM USA voluntarily restricts such programs to adult smokers age 21 or older." ARU6432619-2620 (US 78280)'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite the Overwhelming Evidence to the Contrary, Defendants'' Public', 'orlowsky-wd-8-23-9-11', '1210', 'Orlowsky WD, 8:23-9:11; 82225801-5805 at 5803-5805 (US 55455).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite the Overwhelming Evidence to the Contrary, Defendants'' Public', 'orlowsky-wd-16-20-18-8', '1210', 'Orlowsky WD, 16:20-18:8. These are the same representations made in the Advertising Code and reiterated by Lorillard over the past forty years. Id.; TLT0370590-0592 (US 76628);'),
