('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite the Overwhelming Evidence to the Contrary, Defendants'' Public', 'lorillard-has-set-target-market', '1227', 'Lorillard has set the target market for Newport as twenty-one to thirty-four year-olds since 1994.'),
