('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite the Overwhelming Evidence to the Contrary, Defendants'' Public', 'b-w-further-stated-t', '1231', 'B&W further stated, "[t]oday, our primary focus is on consumer relationship marketing, that is, marketing to specific individuals who have confirmed that they are both adults and smokers."'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'Despite the Overwhelming Evidence to the Contrary, Defendants'' Public', 'vxb3840037-0041-us-78678-emphasis-original', '1231', 'VXB3840037-0041 (US 78678) (emphasis in original).'),
