('us-v-philip-morris', 'Defendants Undertook Joint Efforts to Undermine and Discredit the', 'guide-use-politicians-civil-servants', '1311', 'Guide ("for use with politicians, civil servants, journalists and other opinion-leaders") and a "general leaflet" that addressed "the two major strategic themes of ''demonstrating scientific controversy'' and'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'Defendants Undertook Joint Efforts to Undermine and Discredit the', 'ambient-air-quality-2501155644-5648-5648', '1311', '''ambient air quality.''" 2501155644-5648 at 5648 (US 45901*).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'marked-confidential-infotab-documents-2501155644-5648', '1312', 'MARKED AS CONFIDENTIAL INFOTAB DOCUMENTS. 2501155644-5648 at 5648 (US 45901*) (emphasis in original).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'small-group-executives-attend-conference', '1312', 'a small group of executives to attend a conference on Hilton Head Island, South Carolina, to assess the ETS problem and formulate solutions. The conference would come to be known as "Operation Downunder." 2023551340-1343 (US 85518).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '2023551340-1343-us-85518', '1313', '2023551340-1343 (US 85518).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'companies-hamish-maxwell-according-downunder', '1313', 'Companies, Hamish Maxwell. According to the Downunder agenda, the conference began on June'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '23-1987-ended-afternoon-june', '1313', '23, 1987, and ended on the afternoon of June 26 with the presentation of a plan to senior management. All expenses were paid by Philip Morris. 2024270524-0527 (US 75083).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'surgeon-general-s-report-told', '1313', 'Surgeon General''s report. He told the conference attendees the industry''s position on passive smoking was restricted to "ETS not shown to be health hazard to non-smoker." He cautioned that:'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'we-cannot-say-ets-safe', '1314', '"We cannot say ETS is ''safe'' and if we do, this is a ''dangerous'' statement.''" 2021502102-2134 at'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'philip-morris-companies-group-recommended', '1315', 'Philip Morris Companies. The group recommended a "dramatic increase in scientific activity on ETS." The group additionally recommended what they called an "NRA strategy" of "select[ing] the weakest of our enemies, mak[ing] an active effort to defeat them in the next election, then let[ting] people know what we did and why we did it," in conjunction with the "financial support" of industry friends. The increased funding of CIAR, the increased recruitment of "consulting scientists," and the establishment of an industry "scientific journal" were to play roles in the industry "solution" as well. 2021502671-2678 (US 22950).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '2021502671-2678-2676-us-22950', '1315', '2021502671-2678 at 2676 (US 22950).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'liggett-american-tobacco-institute-covington', '1316', 'Liggett, American, the Tobacco Institute, and Covington & Burling were invited by the Tobacco Institute to develop a consensus recommendation for the Executive Committee. Tobacco Institute vice president Roger Mozingo wrote that:'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'tidn0002710-2719-2711-us-65548-506617595-7596', '1316', 'TIDN0002710-2719 at 2711 (US 65548); 506617595-7596 (US 20760).'),
