('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'downunder-recommendations-london-batco-other', '1317', 'Downunder recommendations in London to BATCo and other European cigarette manufacturers to bring them on board. BATCo Scientific Director Sharon Boyse (Blackie) recorded the following from the London meeting:'),
