('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '2505442777-2960-us-25643-83205526-5581-us', '1327', '2505442777-2960 (US 25643*); 83205526-5581 (US 92033) (Applied Projects are indicated with the notation "Other"). Defendants spent over $21.5 million in, or one-third of its total funding, on'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'ciar-applied-projects-2505442777-2960-us', '1327', 'CIAR "Applied Projects." 2505442777-2960 (US 25643*); 83205526-5581 (US 92033).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'sarah-liao-hazleton-project-jenkins', '1327', 'Sarah Liao, the Hazleton Project, and the Jenkins/ORNL projects. Rupp continued, "What we have learned over the past five years, the period of CIAR''s existence, is that CIAR can make -- indeed, already has made -- an important contribution to the industry''s efforts to fight unwarranted smoking restrictions." 87602277-2281 at 2278-2279 (US 23516).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '2023132080-2081-2080-us-92031', '1328', '2023132080-2081 at 2080 (US 92031).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '400974598-4600-4598-4600-us-47526', '1329', '400974598-4600 at 4598, 4600 (US 47526).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'may-be-i-m-not', '1329', 'MAY be (I''m not convinced yet) a reason to say it was sponsored by CIAR so as to "hide" industry involvement (as was done in Rupp''s ''Asia project'')." 2023544456 (US 22816) (emphasis in original).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '87602277-2281-2278-us-23516', '1330', '87602277-2281 at 2278 (US 23516).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '2015007199-7207-7205-us-20311', '1330', '2015007199-7207 at 7205 (US 20311).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'sab-order-counter-impact-studies', '1331', 'SAB, in order to counter the impact of studies linking ETS and disease and to generate data favorable to the industry''s public ETS position. Several CIAR-sponsored Applied Projects are described below to illustrate how CIAR served the industry''s goal of concealing tobacco industry funding and control.'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'tobacco-institute-cited-paper-seemingly', '1333', 'Tobacco Institute cited the paper as seemingly independent authority in support of its March 20, 1992 comments to OSHA denying the need for workplace smoking restrictions. TLT1022319-2405 at 2367 (US 87404).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'spanish-manufacturer-tabacalera-swedish-tobacco', '1334', 'Spanish manufacturer Tabacalera, and the Swedish tobacco organization Reserca. 2021520163-0180'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '2051810375-0377-0376-us-92066', '1335', '2051810375-0377 at 0376 (US 92066).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'down-disband-ciar-within-45', '1337', 'down and disband CIAR within 45 days of "Final Approval." Although the MSA was signed by the parties in November 1998, "Final Approval" by the settling States did not take place until approximately one year later. (no bates at 32-33) (JD 045158).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'several-defendants-other-cigarette-manufacturers', '1338', 'several Defendants and other cigarette manufacturers formed the International ETS Management Committee (IEMC) to (1) fund and manage research on ETS and (2) coordinate the industry''s strategy and position on passive smoking.'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '2500061112-1113-us-22821', '1339', '2500061112-1113 (US 22821).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'afco-v-tobacco-institute-aust', '1340', 'AFCO v. Tobacco Institute (Aust) (1991)27 (...continued) Defendants offered the testimony of Joseph Mulholland as a fact witness, not as an expert. He is a long-time staff economist with the FTC Bureau of Economics, who personally does not agree with the conclusion of Monograph 13 that the introduction of low tar cigarettes has not materially reduced health risks from smoking, even though the FTC has never taken an official position on this issue. Mulholland WD, 12:12-15, 14:3-6, 15:15-23, 16:3-11 (Monograph 13 has not changed the FTC''s position, as the FTC has not taken an official position on the issue); Mulholland TT, 4/25/05, 19854:16-19855:3. While recognizing that Dr. Mulholland has acquired extensive knowledge, in his capacity as an FTC staff economist, concerning cigarette-related matters, as the Court observed at the trial, his "testimony is not that overwhelmingly relevant." Mulholland TT, 4/25/05, 19938:16- 19939:1. -780-Show full note FCR 149.'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'afco-v-tobacco-institute-aust-2', '1340', 'AFCO v. Tobacco Institute (Aust) (1991)27 (...continued) Defendants offered the testimony of Joseph Mulholland as a fact witness, not as an expert. He is a long-time staff economist with the FTC Bureau of Economics, who personally does not agree with the conclusion of Monograph 13 that the introduction of low tar cigarettes has not materially reduced health risks from smoking, even though the FTC has never taken an official position on this issue. Mulholland WD, 12:12-15, 14:3-6, 15:15-23, 16:3-11 (Monograph 13 has not changed the FTC''s position, as the FTC has not taken an official position on the issue); Mulholland TT, 4/25/05, 19854:16-19855:3. While recognizing that Dr. Mulholland has acquired extensive knowledge, in his capacity as an FTC staff economist, concerning cigarette-related matters, as the Court observed at the trial, his "testimony is not that overwhelmingly relevant." Mulholland TT, 4/25/05, 19938:16- 19939:1. -780-Show full note FCR 149; upheld on appeal Tobacco Institute (Aust) v. AFCO (1992) 38 FCR 1; Tobacco Institute (Aust) v. AFCO (1993) 41 FCR 89.'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '300522762-2767-2763-us-22223', '1341', '300522762-2767 at 2763 (US 22223).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '500844318-4319-us-48464', '1342', '500844318-4319 (US 48464).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '2501117793-7797-7793-us-27932', '1343', '2501117793-7797 at 7793 (US 27932).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'winokur-wrote-philip-morris-s', '1344', 'Winokur wrote to Philip Morris''s general counsel Steve Parrish in a January 24, 1994 e-mail: "I agree that S & T (Richmond and Neuchatel) must be involved with all phases -- scientific, political and communications -- that come together when developing the industry''s response to the IARC study. And already this is happening." 2029174855-4855 (US 88475); 2024104538-4538 (US 88476).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '2060566164-6165-us-20505', '1346', '2060566164-6165 (US 20505).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', '2063594018-4018-us-39764', '1347', '2063594018-4018 (US 39764).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'IN CONTRAST, THE INTERNAL PAPERS -- OF WHICH THIS INTRODUCTION IS ONE -- ARE FOR USE INSIDE THE INDUSTRY ONLY AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS CONFIDENTIAL. FOR THIS REASON, THE INTERNAL PAPERS HAVE BEEN PRODUCED IN A FORM WHICH IS INAPPROPRIATE FOR PUBLIC USE AND ARE CLEARLY', 'dxa0680223-0233-0233-us-79025', '1347', 'DXA0680223-0233 at 0233 (US 79025).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'PASSIVE SMOKING DOES CAUSE LUNG CANCER; DO NOT LET THEM FOOL YOU', '224460-4461-us-79174', '1348', '224460-4461 (US 79174).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'PASSIVE SMOKING DOES CAUSE LUNG CANCER; DO NOT LET THEM FOOL YOU', 'organizations-recruited-speak-behalf-industry', '1349', 'organizations recruited to speak on behalf of the industry to influence public opinion, government officials, and scientists. As described below, Defendants created the ETS Consultancy Program to attack and discredit the scientific consensus and underlying evidence that passive smoking was a health hazard.'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'PASSIVE SMOKING DOES CAUSE LUNG CANCER; DO NOT LET THEM FOOL YOU', 'simply-keep-controversy-alive-attacking', '1349', 'simply to "keep the controversy alive" by attacking the scientific consensus that ETS was a health hazard. 321140944-0949 at 0944 (US 20586); 2021181803-1812 at 1803 (US 22155); 2047720166-0173 at 0169; (US 23966); 321091680-1729 at 1685 (US 28271).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'PASSIVE SMOKING DOES CAUSE LUNG CANCER; DO NOT LET THEM FOOL YOU', '2501152297-2300-2297-us-89558', '1350', '2501152297-2300 at 2297 (US 89558).'),
('us-v-philip-morris', 'PASSIVE SMOKING DOES CAUSE LUNG CANCER; DO NOT LET THEM FOOL YOU', 'ets-consultancy-program', '1351', 'ETS Consultancy Program:'),
